<title>UK: UK to issue further 350 mln stg in bond tranches.</title>
<headline>UK to issue further 350 mln stg in bond tranches.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said it is issuing 350 million stg of index-linked Treasury stock on Thursday.</p>
<p>The issue comprises 150 million stg of 2.0 percent index-linked Treasury stock due 2006 and 200 million stg of 2.5 percent index-linked stock due 2020.</p>
<p>The stock will be priced later and the Bank will receive bids between 0945 and 0950 GMT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
